    "benefits": "Classes 6th to 8th Boys: â‚¹20/- per month Girls: â‚¹30/- per month Classes 9th to 10th Boys: â‚¹30/- per month Girls: â‚¹40/- per month NOTE:  The scheme is individual in nature, covering all of Madhya Pradesh. Scholarships are awarded for 10 months annually and paid in one installment on 30th September.",
