    "documents": "Photograph of the Family (Legal Heir) of the Deceased. Residential Certificate of the Deceased Fishermen. Proof of Age of the Deceased Fishermen. Declaration That the Deceased Fisherman Was Not a Beneficiary of the Old Age Pension Scheme. Membership Certificate from the President/Administrator of Fishermen/Fisherwoman Co-operative Society. â€˜No Claimâ€™ Certificate in Respect of Financial Assistance Extended by the Revenue Department (to Be Obtained From the Department of Revenue and Disaster Management) for Consideration. Electoral Identity Card (Attested Copy) Ration Card (Attested Copy) Panchayatharâ€™s Letter of Village Concerned Name, Relationship, and Address of the Legal Heir (Affidavit in â‚¹ 5 Stamp Paper, Affixing as the Legal Heir Duly Signed in Before a Notary Public). Death Certificate in Case of Deceased Fishermen.",
